        "original_id": "634c1bcc-61dd-53d4-a6f8-1846fddfc1f5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Bergl, Jeff Daniels, Joel Murray\n- TV series: Shameless, Men in Trees, Desperate Housewives, Southland, Mad Men, Grand, Love & War, Dharma and Greg\n- Films: Chasing Sleep, The Rage: Carrie 2\n- Companies/Networks: ABC, TNT, Showtime\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, Emily Bergl was best known for playing Rachel Lang in the supernatural horror film The Rage: Carrie 2.\n- Chasing Sleep stars Jeff Daniels and Emily Bergl.\n- From 2006 to 2008, Emily Bergl played Annie O'Donnell on the ABC television show Men in Trees.\n- From 2009 to 2013, Emily Bergl played Tammi Bryant on the TNT drama series Southland.\n- From 2010 to 2011, Emily Bergl played Beth Young on Desperate Housewives.\n- Shameless is an American comedy-drama television series that airs on Showtime.\n- Shameless is set in Chicago, is filmed in Los Angeles, and shoots its exterior scenes in Chicago.\n- From 2014 to 2015, Emily Bergl played Sammi Slott in Shameless.\n- Joel Murray has had prominent television roles in Mad Men, Grand, Love & War, Dharma and Greg, and Shameless.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
